  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OECD DAC Voluntary Contribution 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OECD DAC Conribution 2022, ref. Allocation Letter from MFA 25.01.22 is the Norwegian annual contribution to the Programme of Work and Budget (PWB) for the periode 2021-2022, including support to projects and activities both at DAC and at other departments and units at the OECD, to contribute to the development of better policies and practices in the international development cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
